{"id":"17-3042-2-10","zh":"在非全界（asabbadhātuka）语尾前，词根 as 可以替换为 bhū。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3042-11-14","zh":"bhavissati、bhavissanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3042-15-18","zh":"abhavissa、abhavissaṃsu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3043-2-5","zh":"规则里说“**可以**（vā）”，是为了什么？","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3043-6-7","zh":"为了成立 āsuṃ 这样的形式。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-3044-2-12","zh":"brū 的意思是清楚地说话；产生 ti 等语尾，并省略词缀 a。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-3045-2-9","zh":"“kvaci（有时）”一词从前面延续下来。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3046-2-8","zh":"502. 在 ti 之前，brū 之后加 ī。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-3047-2-18","zh":"在 mhi 等语尾前，词根 brū 之后有时**会**插入 ī 音；接着作增音、替换为 av、省略元音等。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-3047-19-53","zh":"bravīti、brūti。根据从“aññesu ca”这条规则延续下来的“vā”字，词根 brū 在辅音前不作增音；复数时，依“jhalānamiyuvā sare vā”规则，ū 音在元音前替换为 uv，得到 bruvanti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3047-54-73","zh":"依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，brū 之后的 ti、anti 可以替换为 a、u，brū 也替换为 āh。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3048-2-5","zh":"āha、āhu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-6-9","zh":"brūsi、brūtha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-10-13","zh":"brūmi、brūma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-14-17","zh":"brūte、bruvante。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-18-21","zh":"brūse、bruvavhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-22-25","zh":"bruve、brūmhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-26-29","zh":"brūtu、bruvantu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-30-33","zh":"brūhi、brūtha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-34-37","zh":"brūmi、brūma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-38-41","zh":"brūtaṃ、bruvantaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-42-47","zh":"bruve、bruveyya、bruveyyuṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-48-51","zh":"bruveyyāsi、bruveyyātha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-52-55","zh":"bruveyyāmi、bruveyyāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-56-59","zh":"bruvetha、bruveraṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3048-60-63","zh":"abruvā、abruvū。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3049-2-28","zh":"在远过去时（parokkhā）中，依“brūbhūnamāhabhūvā parokkhāyaṃ”规则，词根 brū 替换为 āha，再省略元音等，例如：supine kira māha（据说他在梦中对我说）、tenāhu porāṇā（所以古人说），或 āhaṃsu，等等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3050-2-8","zh":"在不定过去时（ajjatanī）中：abravi、abruvi、abravuṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3050-9-10","zh":"bravissati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3050-11-13","zh":"abravissa，等等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3051-2-16","zh":"han 的意思是伤害与行走；在 ti 前有时省略词缀 a：hanti、hanati、hananti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-3051-17-20","zh":"hanasi、hanatha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3051-21-24","zh":"hanāmi、hanāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3052-2-20","zh":"在被动语态中，依“tassa cavagga”等规则变为 ñ，并且重叠：haññate、haññante、haññare。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3052-21-24","zh":"haññati、haññanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3052-25-28","zh":"hanatu、hanantu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3052-29-30","zh":"haneyya。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3053-2-9","zh":"“hanassa（han 的）”一词从前面延续下来。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3054-2-8","zh":"503. 在一切场合，han 都可以替换为 vadha。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3055-2-15","zh":"在一切语尾和词缀前，词根 han 都可以替换为 vadha；或者说，这里的“vā”一词表示有限定的选择（vavatthitavibhāsā）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-3055-16-17","zh":"vadheti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3055-18-19","zh":"vadhīyati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3055-20-21","zh":"vadhetu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3055-22-23","zh":"vadhīyatu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3055-24-25","zh":"vadheyya。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3055-26-29","zh":"avadhi、avadhiṃsu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3055-30-33","zh":"ahani、ahaniṃsu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3055-34-37","zh":"vadhissati、hanissati。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3055-38-43","zh":"替换为 khā 时：paṭihaṅkhāmi；不替换时：paṭihanissāmi。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-3055-44-48","zh":"avadhissa、ahanissa，等等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3056-2-3","zh":"hu 等词根的变化方式。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3057-2-28","zh":"hu 的意思是施予、食用和献供；产生 ti 等语尾和词缀 a，依“kvacādivaṇṇānamekassarānaṃ dvebhāvo”规则重叠，再依“pubbobbhāso”规则把前一部分称为重叠音节（abbhāsa）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3058-2-9","zh":"“abbhāse（在重叠音节中）”一词从前面延续下来。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3059-2-8","zh":"504. h 变为 j。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3060-2-8","zh":"处在重叠音节中的 h 音变为 j。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3060-9-20","zh":"依“lopañcettamakāro”规则省略词缀 a，并作增音。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-3060-21-22","zh":"juhoti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3061-2-13","zh":"不省略的时候，“jhalānaṃ”和“sare”两词从前面延续下来——","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3062-2-7","zh":"505. 也变为 y 音和 v 音。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-3063-2-15","zh":"称为 jha 和 la 的 i 类元音与 u 类元音，后面接元音时，分别替换为 y 音和 v 音；所以不在词末的 u 音变为 v 音。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3064-2-9","zh":"juhvati、juhoti、juhvanti、juhonti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3064-10-17","zh":"juhvasi、juhosi、juhvatha、juhotha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3064-18-25","zh":"juhvāmi、juhomi、juhvāma、juhoma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3065-2-15","zh":"在被动语态中，依“kvaci dhātu”等规则变为长音：hūyate、hūyante。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-3065-16-19","zh":"hūyati、hūyanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3066-2-9","zh":"同样地：juhotu、juhontu，或 juhvantu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3066-10-15","zh":"juhe、juheyya、juheyyuṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3066-16-19","zh":"ajuhavi、ajuhavuṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3066-20-23","zh":"ajuhosi、ajuhosuṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3066-24-26","zh":"ahūyittha aggi（火已经被供奉了）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-3066-27-30","zh":"juhissati、juhissanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3066-31-35","zh":"或 juhossati、juhossanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3066-36-40","zh":"ajuhissa、ajuhissaṃsu，等等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3067-2-13","zh":"hā 的意思是舍弃；和前面一样，作重叠、替换为 j、省略词缀 a。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-3068-2-9","zh":"“abbhāse（在重叠音节中）”一词从前面延续下来。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3069-2-6","zh":"506. 变为短音。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3070-2-7","zh":"处在重叠音节中的元音变为短音。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-3071-2-5","zh":"jahāti、jahanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3071-6-9","zh":"jahāsi、jahātha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-3071-10-13","zh":"jahāmi、jahāma。","confidence":90}
